Brāhmaṇas ministers merchants gather for consecration --- Gaṅgā waters golden vessels whisk umbrella prepared --- White bull horse elephant and maidens wait --- Assembly misses unseen king at sunrise --- Sumantra greets kings and seeks palace door --- Sumantra hails waking king with blessings --- Daśaratha orders Rāma brought quickly --- Sumantra hears Rāma talk on flagged highway --- Sumantra reaches and enters Rāma Kailāsa-like mansion